1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,180
A vaccine can

2
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,140
be ruined long

3
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:02,940
before it reaches

4
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:03,740
your arm.

5
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:04,380
And no one

6
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:05,076
would see it.

7
00:00:05,176 --> 00:00:06,456
Most vaccines must

8
00:00:06,456 --> 00:00:07,240
stay between two

9
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,456
and eight degrees

10
00:00:08,456 --> 00:00:09,210
Celsius.

11
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:10,030
Too warm,

12
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:10,590
and they lose

13
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:11,310
strength.

14
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:11,950
Frozen,

15
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:12,910
many are damaged

16
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:13,549
for good.

17
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:14,450
So they travel

18
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:15,570
a cold chain:

19
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:16,690
an unbroken line

20
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:17,330
of cold,

21
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,210
