23
00:00:18,914 --> 00:00:20,274
Refrigerated trucks

24
00:00:20,274 --> 00:00:21,874
and insulated boxes

25
00:00:21,874 --> 00:00:23,300
keep them in range.

26
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,920
Data loggers record

27
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:25,880
the temperature around

28
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:26,644
the clock.

29
00:00:26,744 --> 00:00:27,784
Some vials carry

30
00:00:27,784 --> 00:00:28,504
a label that

31
00:00:28,504 --> 00:00:29,304
darkens with too

32
00:00:29,304 --> 00:00:29,968
much heat.

33
00:00:30,068 --> 00:00:31,108
At the pharmacy,

34
00:00:31,108 --> 00:00:32,308
a dedicated fridge

35
00:00:32,308 --> 00:00:33,108
is checked every

36
00:00:33,108 --> 00:00:33,815
workday.

37
00:00:33,915 --> 00:00:34,635
If it slips

38
00:00:34,635 --> 00:00:35,595
out of range,

39
00:00:35,595 --> 00:00:36,555
doses are set

40
00:00:36,555 --> 00:00:37,915
aside until experts

41
00:00:37,915 --> 00:00:38,795
decide if they're

42
00:00:38,795 --> 00:00:39,404
usable.

43
00:00:39,504 --> 00:00:40,544
A vaccine only

44
00:00:40,544 --> 00:00:41,344
protects you if

45
00:00:41,344 --> 00:00:42,544
the cold held,

46
00:00:42,544 --> 00:00:43,104
all the way

47
00:00:43,104 --> 00:00:43,910
to your arm.
